<title>SINGAPORE: Orchard Parade in 2-for-5 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Orchard Parade in 2-for-5 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel and property group Orchard Parade Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it was proposing a bonus issue on the basis of two shares for every five held.</p>
<p>It made the announcement in conjunction with the release of its 1996 full-year results which showed a 109.7 percent increase in net profit to Singapore $24.82 million.</p>
<p>Orchard Parade said it was making the issue in view of the results and in conjunction with its 30th anniversary.</p>
<p>The proposal would involve the issue of a minimum of 83.04 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
